        "html": "<!--\n  =====================================================================\n  1% | COMPROMISSO INDIVIDUAL  ·  B3 × Hyper Island\n  PÁGINA DO PARTICIPANTE (mobile)\n  ---------------------------------------------------------------------\n  Como usar no Shopify:\n  1. Crie uma página no Shopify (ex.: /pages/b3-1-porcento).\n  2. Cole TODO este código em uma seção \"Custom Liquid\" (ou \"HTML\n     personalizado\") do template da página. O editor de texto rico da\n     página pode remover <script>, então prefira a seção Custom Liquid.\n  3. Preencha o bloco CONFIG abaixo com os mesmos dados do Firebase\n     usados no painel. Enquanto o apiKey começar com \"COLE\", a página\n     roda em MODO DEMONSTRAÇÃO (salva só no navegador, para testes).\n  A página ocupa a tela inteira e fica isolada do CSS do tema (Shadow DOM).\n  =====================================================================\n-->\n<div id=\"b3pct-participante\"></div>\n\n<template id=\"b3pct-participante-tpl\">\n<style>\n  :host { all: initial; }\n  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n\n  .app {\n    --vibrante: #1818b7;\n    --profundo: #0a0349;\n    --coral: #f5ba94;\n    --ceu: #dde9f6;\n    --terracota: #ea5744;\n    --display: \"B3 Sans Display\", \"Ubuntu\", system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n    --text: \"B3 Sans Text\", \"Ubuntu\", system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n\n    position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 2147483000;\n    background: var(--vibrante);\n    color: #fff;\n    font-family: var(--text);\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n    overflow-x: hidden; overflow-y: auto;\n    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\n    overscroll-behavior: contain;\n    text-align: left;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- fundo: colchetes gigantes ---------- */\n  .bg { position: fixed; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; overflow: hidden; }\n  .bg i {\n    position: absolute; display: block;\n    width: 34vmax; height: 110vmax;\n    border: 4.4vmax solid rgba(255,255,255,.055);\n  }\n  .bg i:first-child { left: -22vmax; top: -8vmax; border-right: 0; }\n  .bg i:last-child  { right: -22vmax; bottom: -30vmax; border-left: 0; }\n\n  .wrap {\n    position: relative;\n    min-height: 100%;\n    max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: max(22px, env(safe-area-inset-top)) 22px max(28px, env(safe-area-inset-bottom));\n    display: flex; flex-direction: column;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- marcas ---------- */\n  .brands { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; color: #fff; }\n  .brands .b3 { display: block; height: 34px; }\n  .brands .b3 svg { height: 100%; width: auto; display: block; }\n  .brands .sep { width: 1px; height: 22px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.35); }\n  .brands .hi { display: block; height: 11px; }\n  .brands .hi svg { height: 100%; width: auto; display: block; }\n\n  /* ---------- hero ---------- */\n  .hero { margin-top: clamp(28px, 6vh, 64px); }\n  .eyebrow {\n    font: 700 12px/1 var(--display);\n    letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--coral);\n  }\n  .mark {\n    display: inline-flex; align-items: stretch;\n    margin-top: 18px;\n    font: 700 clamp(92px, 29vw, 156px)/.86 var(--display);\n    letter-spacing: -.04em;\n    color: #fff;\n  }\n  .mark .br { width: .2em; border: .07em solid var(--coral); }\n  .mark .br.l { border-right: 0; }\n  .mark .br.r { border-left: 0; }\n  .mark .num { padding: .1em .1em .06em .06em; }\n\n  h1 {\n    margin-top: 22px;\n    font: 700 clamp(27px, 7.4vw, 38px)/1.1 var(--display);\n    letter-spacing: -.015em;\n    color: #fff;\n    text-transform: none;\n  }\n  h1 em { font-style: normal; color: var(--coral); }\n  .lede {\n    margin-top: 14px;\n    font: 400 16px/1.5 var(--text);\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,.82);\n    max-width: 30em;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- formulário ---------- */\n  form {\n    margin-top: 28px;\n    background: #fff; color: var(--profundo);\n    padding: 20px 18px 18px;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    box-shadow: 0 40px 80px -30px rgba(10,3,73,.75);\n  }\n  .lbl {\n    display: block;\n    font: 700 11px/1 var(--display);\n    letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--vibrante);\n  }\n  .field {\n    position: relative; margin-top: 12px;\n    background: #f4f7fc;\n    padding: 14px 16px 10px;\n    transition: background .2s;\n  }\n  .field::before, .field::after {\n    content: \"\"; position: absolute; width: 18px; height: 18px;\n    border: 3px solid var(--vibrante);\n    transition: width .25s, height .25s, border-color .25s;\n  }\n  .field::before { left: 0; top: 0; border-right: 0; border-bottom: 0; }\n  .field::after  { right: 0; bottom: 0; border-left: 0; border-top: 0; }\n  .field:focus-within { background: #eef3fb; }\n  .field:focus-within::before, .field:focus-within::after { width: 30px; height: 30px; }\n\n  textarea {\n    display: block; width: 100%;\n    min-height: 132px; resize: none;\n    border: 0; outline: 0; background: transparent;\n    font: 500 19px/1.4 var(--display);\n    color: var(--profundo);\n    -webkit-appearance: none; appearance: none;\n  }\n  textarea::placeholder, input::placeholder { color: #8b8fb3; opacity: 1; }\n  .meta { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; margin-top: 4px; }\n  .count { font: 500 12px/1 var(--text); color: #8b8fb3; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n  .count.warn { color: var(--terracota); }\n\n  .name { margin-top: 18px; }\n  input[type=\"text\"] {\n    display: block; width: 100%;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    border: 0; border-bottom: 2px solid #d5daea; border-radius: 0;\n    background: transparent; outline: 0;\n    padding: 8px 0 10px;\n    font: 500 17px/1.3 var(--text);\n    color: var(--profundo);\n    transition: border-color .2s;\n    -webkit-appearance: none; appearance: none;\n  }\n  input[type=\"text\"]:focus { border-bottom-color: var(--vibrante); }\n  .hint { margin-top: 8px; font: 400 12.5px/1.4 var(--text); color: #6b6f95; }\n\n  button:focus { outline: none; }\n  button:focus-visible, textarea:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--coral); outline-offset: 3px; }\n  textarea:focus-visible { outline: none; }\n  button {\n    font-family: var(--display); cursor: pointer; border: 0;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    text-transform: none; letter-spacing: normal;\n  }\n  .send {\n    margin-top: 22px; width: 100%; height: 58px;\n    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 12px;\n    background: var(--profundo); color: #fff;\n    font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n    transition: background .2s, transform .1s, opacity .2s;\n  }\n  .send svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; color: var(--coral); transition: transform .2s; }\n  .send:hover:not(:disabled) { background: var(--vibrante); }\n  .send:hover:not(:disabled) svg { transform: translateX(3px); }\n  .send:active:not(:disabled) { transform: scale(.985); }\n  .send:disabled { opacity: .35; cursor: not-allowed; }\n  .send.loading { opacity: 1; cursor: progress; }\n  .send.loading .lbl-send, .send.loading svg { display: none; }\n  .spin {\n    display: none; width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 3px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25); border-top-color: var(--coral);\n    animation: spin .8s linear infinite;\n  }\n  .send.loading .spin { display: block; }\n  @keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }\n\n  .error {\n    display: none; margin-top: 12px;\n    font: 500 14px/1.4 var(--text); color: #c0392b;\n  }\n  .error.show { display: block; }\n\n  .note {\n    display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-top: 18px;\n    font: 400 13.5px/1.45 var(--text); color: rgba(255,255,255,.78);\n  }\n  .note svg { flex: none; width: 18px; height: 18px; margin-top: 1px; color: var(--coral); }\n\n  .demo {\n    margin-top: 22px; align-self: flex-start;\n    font: 700 10px/1 var(--display); letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--profundo); background: var(--coral);\n    padding: 6px 9px; border-radius: 2px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- tela de sucesso ---------- */\n  .done { display: none; margin-top: clamp(36px, 9vh, 90px); }\n  .app.sent .hero, .app.sent form, .app.sent .note { display: none; }\n  .app.sent .done { display: block; animation: rise .6s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1) both; }\n  @keyframes rise { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(18px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }\n\n  .check {\n    width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--coral); color: var(--profundo);\n    display: grid; place-items: center;\n  }\n  .check svg { width: 30px; height: 30px; }\n  .check path { stroke-dasharray: 30; stroke-dashoffset: 30; animation: draw .5s .25s ease-out forwards; }\n  @keyframes draw { to { stroke-dashoffset: 0; } }\n\n  .done h2 {\n    margin-top: 26px;\n    font: 700 clamp(30px, 8.4vw, 42px)/1.06 var(--display);\n    letter-spacing: -.02em; color: #fff; text-transform: none;\n  }\n  .done h2 em { font-style: normal; color: var(--coral); }\n  .done p { margin-top: 12px; font: 400 16px/1.5 var(--text); color: rgba(255,255,255,.82); }\n\n  .quote { display: flex; align-items: stretch; margin-top: 30px; }\n  .quote .br { flex: none; width: 16px; border: 4px solid var(--coral); }\n  .quote .br.l { border-right: 0; }\n  .quote .br.r { border-left: 0; }\n  .quote .body { padding: 16px 16px; flex: 1; }\n  .quote .txt { font: 500 20px/1.4 var(--display); color: #fff; word-break: break-word; }\n  .quote .who {\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    font: 700 11px/1 var(--display); letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--coral);\n  }\n  .quote .who:empty { display: none; }\n\n  .again {\n    margin-top: 34px; height: 52px; padding: 0 22px;\n    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\n    background: transparent; color: #fff;\n    border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.5); border-radius: 2px;\n    font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700;\n    transition: border-color .2s, background .2s;\n  }\n  .again:hover { border-color: #fff; background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); }\n  .again svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; }\n\n  .foot { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 36px; font: 400 11px/1.4 var(--text); color: rgba(255,255,255,.5); }\n\n  .bg { display: none; }\n  @media (min-width: 720px) {\n    .bg { display: block; }\n    .wrap { padding-top: 40px; }\n    form { padding: 26px 26px 24px; }\n  }\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    *, *::before, *::after { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; }\n    .check path { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"app\" part=\"app\">\n  <div class=\"bg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<i></i><i></i>\n</div>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"brands\">\n      <span class=\"b3\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"B3\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 2983 2559\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M 2740.4 0.9 C 2653.1 8.8,2589.6 54.4,2561.5 129.5 C 2557.5 140.1,2551.6 162,2550.5 170.7 L 2549.8 176 2626.4 176 C 2698.6 176,2703 175.9,2703 174.2 C 2703 171,2709.6 157.1,2714.3 150.5 C 2730.7 127.6,2762.5 119.1,2793 129.5 C 2836.1 144.1,2841.5 200.6,2801.7 220.3 C 2787.5 227.3,2781.6 228.2,2744.7 228.7 L 2712 229.2 2712 285.1 L 2712 341 2745.9 341 C 2781.5 341,2787.9 341.5,2800.3 345.9 C 2824.9 354.5,2838 376.7,2833.6 402.3 C 2830.1 422.6,2817.3 436.4,2795 444.1 C 2781.5 448.7,2759.2 449,2746.3 444.6 C 2730 439.2,2717.3 427.6,2709.1 410.8 L 2704.5 401.1 2624.6 401 L 2544.7 401 2545.4 406.7 C 2547.6 424.2,2555.9 449.3,2565.6 467.9 C 2607 546.9,2704.8 588.3,2812.6 572.4 C 2905.9 558.7,2974.1 496.2,2981.8 417.5 C 2982.1 413.6,2982.7 893.8,2983 1484.5 L 2983.5 2558.5 2983.5 1378 C 2983.5 728.7,2983.2 242,2983 296.5 C 2982.7 350.9,2982.3 393,2982.2 389.9 C 2980.1 342.5,2959.4 307.9,2918.4 283.4 C 2917 282.6,2918.1 281.4,2925.6